So, I guess he's just putting
it in here for one more go.

01:02:04.610 --> 01:02:08.170
And this is very interesting from Locke.

01:02:08.170 --> 01:02:12.360
Do you actually like the way beans taste?

01:02:12.360 --> 01:02:13.880
Oh, yeah.

01:02:13.880 --> 01:02:15.260
Which this is getting at...

01:02:15.260 --> 01:02:17.070
This is an interesting thing, right?

01:02:17.070 --> 01:02:20.640
Because there is kinda what
you were getting at before,

01:02:20.640 --> 01:02:23.680
which is when you live your life

01:02:23.680 --> 01:02:25.913
as a form of entertainment for people,

01:02:27.050 --> 01:02:28.630
you say things and you do things,

01:02:28.630 --> 01:02:30.240
you say and you do things for show.

01:02:30.240 --> 01:02:35.240
So, I've talked about
how my hatred of cats,

01:02:36.700 --> 01:02:40.300
I mean, I'm a dog person,
and I don't want a cat

01:02:40.300 --> 01:02:42.640
and I don't particularly like cats.

01:02:42.640 --> 01:02:46.140
But a hatred of cats is
something that came from

01:02:47.460 --> 01:02:50.180
A hard take.
Being in character.

01:02:50.180 --> 01:02:51.060
Yeah.

01:02:51.060 --> 01:02:53.370
And so I don't hate cats.

01:02:53.370 --> 01:02:56.240
But it's fun to make
people think you hate cats

01:02:56.240 --> 01:02:59.810
because they get their panties in a wad

01:02:59.810 --> 01:03:01.160
and it's entertaining to me.

01:03:01.160 --> 01:03:03.110
All right, so is that true for beans?

01:03:03.110 --> 01:03:04.950
Are you back to Locke word?

01:03:04.950 --> 01:03:06.750
You don't like the taste of beans?

01:03:06.750 --> 01:03:10.470
No, I do love the taste of beans.

01:03:10.470 --> 01:03:11.573
And--
Really?

01:03:13.680 --> 01:03:15.870
I love the taste of beans.

01:03:15.870 --> 01:03:18.650
Do you have any idea how
many beans I've eaten

01:03:18.650 --> 01:03:21.351
and how many beans I've
made during this time?

01:03:21.351 --> 01:03:25.390
Okay, hey, I think we're
all happy to hear it.

01:03:25.390 --> 01:03:27.540
On Saturday, I made a giant pot of beans

01:03:27.540 --> 01:03:31.280
and most of my family eats
them as well, it's not just me.

01:03:31.280 --> 01:03:34.700
But no, I do like the taste
of beans legitimately.

01:03:34.700 --> 01:03:37.380
I like to taste the
beans, that's not an act,

01:03:37.380 --> 01:03:38.900
is not an act.

01:03:38.900 --> 01:03:40.540
Seems like Locke should know that though,

01:03:40.540 --> 01:03:42.230
If he lives with you.

01:03:42.230 --> 01:03:44.200
Seems a little suspicious.

01:03:44.200 --> 01:03:45.240
I found it interesting that

01:03:45.240 --> 01:03:47.363
he asked the question in that way.

01:03:48.200 --> 01:03:49.600
But it's true, I like beans.

01:03:50.620 --> 01:03:53.713
What is your dad's favorite
thing to do with his free time?

01:03:54.590 --> 01:03:56.090
Okay.
Locke had

01:03:56.090 --> 01:03:57.883
an interesting perspective on this,

01:03:58.807 --> 01:04:00.787
"Stress out about work."

01:04:03.354 --> 01:04:04.860
That's true.
So, that's his perspective

01:04:04.860 --> 01:04:06.370
is that I'm stressing out about work.

01:04:06.370 --> 01:04:08.867
Interestingly Shep said,

01:04:08.867 --> 01:04:13.377
"meditate/ work more.

01:04:13.377 --> 01:04:17.380
"He is like a working
machine, it's insane."

01:04:17.380 --> 01:04:18.213
Wow.

01:04:19.100 --> 01:04:20.740
They both think that you work a lot

01:04:20.740 --> 01:04:23.180
or worry about working a lot.

01:04:23.180 --> 01:04:26.600
And it's funny because
I think that they...

01:04:26.600 --> 01:04:28.210
'Cause I've been at home.

01:04:28.210 --> 01:04:29.043
Yeah.

01:04:29.043 --> 01:04:31.710
There's no real work day anymore.

01:04:31.710 --> 01:04:33.420
And so even on the weekends sometimes

01:04:33.420 --> 01:04:35.430
I'll be like writing
something or doing something.

01:04:35.430 --> 01:04:37.787
And a lot of times you're like,
"Hey, dad, "can we do this?

01:04:37.787 --> 01:04:39.360
"Or do you wanna do this?"

01:04:39.360 --> 01:04:41.690
And I'm like, hold on, let me finish this,

01:04:41.690 --> 01:04:43.440
or I got to do this right now.

01:04:43.440 --> 01:04:46.150
And I think they're just
getting this perspective that

01:04:46.150 --> 01:04:47.210
he's always working.

01:04:47.210 --> 01:04:49.830
Which I do work probably
more than I should.

01:04:49.830 --> 01:04:51.080
Lando said my favorite thing to do

01:04:51.080 --> 01:04:53.047
in my free time was, "Nap."

01:04:53.960 --> 01:04:57.797
Lincoln said, my favorite thing
to do in my free time was,

01:04:57.797 --> 01:04:59.157
"Sit in the hammock."

01:05:00.620 --> 01:05:02.203
And then Lily said,

01:05:03.650 --> 01:05:05.127
favorite thing to do in my free time was,

01:05:05.127 --> 01:05:07.727
"Sleep outside on the swing."

01:05:08.937 --> 01:05:10.090
So--
So,

01:05:10.090 --> 01:05:13.220
my kids think that I work a lot

01:05:13.220 --> 01:05:15.540
and your kids think that you sleep a lot.

01:05:15.540 --> 01:05:17.510
Yeah.

01:05:17.510 --> 01:05:19.580
What does that tell you?

01:05:19.580 --> 01:05:21.140
Probably tells you

01:05:21.140 --> 01:05:22.840
something that I didn't want you to know

01:05:22.840 --> 01:05:26.250
which is I sleep a lot.

01:05:26.250 --> 01:05:27.920
When you're thinking about work,

01:05:27.920 --> 01:05:30.763
I'm swinging and sleeping.

01:05:34.870 --> 01:05:36.450
Sorry man, sorry man.

01:05:36.450 --> 01:05:38.810
You know what, keep it up,
don't change the thing.

01:05:38.810 --> 01:05:40.119
It's cool, great.
No, I won't.

01:05:42.487 --> 01:05:44.610
Okay, and now finally.
Okay, last question.

01:05:44.610 --> 01:05:46.110
If you could pick one celebrity

01:05:46.110 --> 01:05:49.580
