Nicolas Cage is gonna play

01:05:59.650 --> 01:06:01.320
the "Tiger King?"
"Tiger King."

01:06:01.320 --> 01:06:02.843
Yeah.
I hope that's true.

01:06:04.600 --> 01:06:06.030
I hope it's true.

01:06:06.030 --> 01:06:07.530
I hear both, he'll be great.

01:06:08.471 --> 01:06:12.137
Lando said, "I would pick Hannah Gatsby."

01:06:13.409 --> 01:06:15.670
The Kiwi stand up comedian

01:06:15.670 --> 01:06:17.280
who had the Netflix special.

01:06:17.280 --> 01:06:20.332
He said, "Because her hair is like dad's"

01:06:22.500 --> 01:06:26.510
Your youngest son picked a woman

01:06:26.510 --> 01:06:27.910
to play you.

01:06:27.910 --> 01:06:31.270
I mean, he's getting on the
Rachel Maddow bandwagon,

01:06:31.270 --> 01:06:33.510
but he's taking it up a notch.

01:06:33.510 --> 01:06:35.320
But no, no, here's the thing,

01:06:35.320 --> 01:06:39.370
Lando does not have it in
himself to insult anyone.

01:06:39.370 --> 01:06:42.000
So, he's not doing this as a joke.

01:06:42.000 --> 01:06:44.610
He's doing this as his honest take

01:06:44.610 --> 01:06:48.543
is that Hannah Gatsby
would make a great Link.

01:06:51.320 --> 01:06:52.380
You know what, that's great,

01:06:52.380 --> 01:06:54.050
you know what?
It's great.

01:06:54.050 --> 01:06:55.650
I watched a little bit of the special

01:06:55.650 --> 01:06:57.100
and then we got distracted by something.

01:06:57.100 --> 01:06:59.340
I never went back to it but I will take it

01:06:59.340 --> 01:07:00.570
as a sincere complement.

01:07:00.570 --> 01:07:05.060
Well, this would be an
interesting set if Hannah Gatsby

01:07:05.060 --> 01:07:09.428
did play you because
Locke said, "Jason Momoa."

01:07:09.428 --> 01:07:10.620
Oh gosh.

01:07:10.620 --> 01:07:12.030
Go to your magic.
Jason Momoa.

01:07:12.030 --> 01:07:12.863
Jason Momoa

01:07:12.863 --> 01:07:15.570
and Hannah Gatsby.
Hannah Gatsby.

01:07:15.570 --> 01:07:17.350
That's a bon coming.

01:07:17.350 --> 01:07:18.883
Shep said,

01:07:19.793 --> 01:07:23.987
" Link because it would be interesting."

01:07:23.987 --> 01:07:28.130
So, Shepard likes the
idea of us doing something

01:07:28.130 --> 01:07:32.600
where you play me and I
guess I would then play you.

01:07:32.600 --> 01:07:35.561
No, I will play you and
Hannah Gatsby will play me.

01:07:35.561 --> 01:07:37.727
That's the take.

01:07:37.727 --> 01:07:40.533
Well, then that would just
be twins like Danny DeVito

01:07:40.533 --> 01:07:42.700
and Arnold Schwarzenegger.

01:07:44.219 --> 01:07:46.850
That's wasn't though,
there's no irony in that.

01:07:46.850 --> 01:07:47.683
That's not the point

01:07:47.683 --> 01:07:49.466
in that movie, but I
have not seen that movie,

01:07:49.466 --> 01:07:50.550
so I don't know--
It will be twins--

01:07:50.550 --> 01:07:51.921
if it's true.
Without irony.

01:07:51.921 --> 01:07:53.350
Yeah.
I don't know if twins

01:07:53.350 --> 01:07:55.760
holds up, so I can't say,
I would suggest that.

01:07:55.760 --> 01:07:57.773
So, what did you learn here?
What did you know?

01:07:57.773 --> 01:08:00.290
I mean, our kids...

01:08:00.290 --> 01:08:03.273
I think our kids are much more
a level ahead than we are.

01:08:04.610 --> 01:08:07.022
Some of them were wise enough to know that

01:08:07.022 --> 01:08:09.000
they didn't need to fill
out all these questions

01:08:09.000 --> 01:08:12.700
