know that it's conditional.

01:08:12.700 --> 01:08:15.100
And that may not be the best fathers,

01:08:15.100 --> 01:08:16.770
but we love them unconditionally.

01:08:16.770 --> 01:08:19.350
We love them with everything we've got.

01:08:19.350 --> 01:08:21.630
Actually, I didn't get any
of that from the survey.

01:08:21.630 --> 01:08:23.120
I'm just trying to project.

01:08:23.120 --> 01:08:24.530
I would say that I didn't...

01:08:24.530 --> 01:08:27.210
I mean, I didn't learn anything

01:08:28.850 --> 01:08:29.893
