01:08:47.810 --> 01:08:50.130
So, I need to be less trope-ish.

01:08:50.130 --> 01:08:51.390
I think I'm gonna make a short

01:08:51.390 --> 01:08:52.800
and says get with the program.

01:08:52.800 --> 01:08:54.603
That's good, I like that.

